# Proof: F-V3-PROGMEM
# Top: v3_progmem
# Assumptions: Initial sampled reset; arbitrary subsequent inputs.
# Properties: Macro tie-offs and A_MEN, read data at N+1 matches the word
#   written to an arbitrary address, image_complete iff all 256 bitmap bits
#   are set, a write sets exactly one bit, invalidate clears all bits.
# Method: temporal induction; bounded success alone is insufficient.
# Scope and abstractions: formal/README.md. Proves the inferred register-file
#   model; the macro itself is covered by the FUNCTIONAL simulation run.

read_verilog -formal -Isrc src/v3_progmem.v
prep -top v3_progmem
flatten
memory_map
opt
async2sync
dffunmap
sat -seq 4 -tempinduct -maxsteps 16 -set-assumes -prove-asserts -verify
